much, maybe an \"automatic\" setting that sets up a reasonable default (just copying from the current camera and XR origin), which folks can disable, and make their own nodes if they need more control?\n\nAlso, I worry a bit about having the 2nd `XROrigin3D` node. When unloading an old scene (which has the main `XROrigin3D` node) and loading another, I think it might be possible for the foveated inset one to become \"current\" because I don't think we are segregating `XROrigin3D` nodes by viewport (like we do for cameras).\n\nPerhaps we should be segregating `XROrigin3D` nodes by viewport?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118511#pullrequestreview-4101474049","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118511","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-13T20:19:28Z"},{"id":4109467887,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc708YDv","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"e132bb1e0f8f84b090f47e3becbfb2938e1eeef1","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118511#pullrequestreview-4109467887","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118511","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-14T22:00:42Z"},{"id":4113841239,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc71NDxX","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"e132bb1e0f8f84b090f47e3becbfb2938e1eeef1","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?u=96b5dc9be2859dca5f31314c87d99a68a21e1576&v=4","cr